WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.770
Lamp for admins. Part three: funders.

2
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:11.020
Funders is the list of who Lamp sends files to. A file can only go to a funder on this list.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.050
Click Add funder. Give it a name and a type: direct, ISO, bank, or other.

4
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.680
Commission points is what the funder pays Lamp. Five means five percent of the funded amount.

5
00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:28.360
Paper grades are the credit grades it takes, like A, B and C.

6
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:38.840
Then its rules: minimum and maximum amount, minimum monthly deposits, months in business, credit score, and how many open positions it allows.

7
00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:44.580
List the industries and states it won't fund. Lamp only matches files that fit every rule.

8
00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:52.160
Where files go is the funder's submission email. Add their contact, and their portal link if they have one.

9
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:59.970
Send automatically sends every matching file to that funder as soon as it has a signed application and three statements.

10
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.990
Turn it on only for funders you trust with every file that fits.

11
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:09.870
Files go out by email from the partners mailbox. Connect it once, here.

12
00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:15.680
Edit changes a funder. Make it inactive to stop sending to it, without losing its history.

13
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.670
Next: the dashboard and money.
